Phase 2: Assign Interfaces (First Boot)
When pfSense boots, you'll see the console menu.

Step	Action
1	Select Option 1: Assign Interfaces
2	Type n for VLANs
3	Assign WAN: em0
4	Assign LAN: em1
5	Assign OPT1: em2 (press Enter to skip if not needed)
6	Type y to proceed


Phase 3: Set LAN IP Address
Step	Action
1	Select Option 2: Set interface(s) IP address
2	Select 2 for LAN
3	Enter IP: 192.168.56.1
4	Enter Subnet: 24
5	Upstream gateway: press Enter
6	Enable DHCP: y
7	DHCP range: 192.168.56.100 → 192.168.56.200
8	Revert to HTTP? n
